{#
  Package: vainfo
  Description: Command-line utility to query VAAPI driver capabilities.
  
  This package is a client-side diagnostic tool (part of libva-utils).
  It does NOT provide a listening network service, does NOT manage a
  database, cache, or any backend state. It simply inspects the local
  VAAPI installation.
  
  Therefore, there is no configuration template to generate.
  This template is intentionally empty.
#}